@startuml AIC_Dual_Call_Sequence
title 《天台十句》AIC · 主回合双调用\n<size:14>UML 时序图 · 剧情生成 → 结构化评价 → 程序结算</size>

hide footbox
autonumber "<b>00</b>"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam CaptionFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #172B4D
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam Padding 12

participant "主线客户端\nVue / Pinia" as Client #F0F5FB
participant "回合编排\nGo / Gin" as Chat #EAF1FB
participant "剧情 LLM\n自然对白" as Story #EBF5F3
participant "裁判 LLM\n结构化评价" as Judge #F1EFF9

Client -> Client : 记录本句，消耗 1 次机会
Client -> Chat : POST /api/chat\n本句 + 历史 + 状态
activate Chat

group ① 剧情生成
  Chat -> Story : 角色 Prompt + 完整历史 + 本句
  activate Story
  Story --> Chat : 自然对白 reply
  deactivate Story
  Chat -> Chat : 清洗对白中的机制标签
end

group ② 独立评价
  Chat -> Judge : 裁判 Prompt + 本句 + reply\n最近 4 条历史 + 状态
  activate Judge
  Judge --> Chat : evaluation JSON\n情绪 · 姿态 · 信任 · 压力 · 结局
  deactivate Judge
end

group ③ 程序校验与结算
  Chat -> Chat : 解析 JSON、归一化字段\n按结算信任拦截低信任离开
  Chat --> Client : reply + evaluation
  deactivate Chat
  Client -> Client : 先扣信任损耗，再加信任\n更新姿态、情绪与结局\n十句耗尽时执行结局兜底
end

caption 离开行动由裁判按叙事判断；信任门槛由程序校验。\n提示与复盘分别通过 /api/hint 和 /api/ending-summary 调用。
@enduml

